  "latex": "I_{\\mathrm{rms}} = \\frac{I_0}{\\sqrt{2}} \\approx 0.707 I_0, \\quad V_{\\mathrm{rms}} = \\frac{V_0}{\\sqrt{2}} \\approx 0.707 V_0",
